"Language: zh_TW\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"

msgid "MODS"
msgstr "模組"

msgid "Open a mod window, or change its key."
msgstr "打開模組視窗，或更改它的快速鍵。"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "關閉"

msgid "Close  ({0})"
msgstr "關閉（{0}）"

msgid "This menu"
msgstr "此選單"

msgid "this menu"
msgstr "此選單"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "無"

msgid "No mod has a window here yet."
msgstr "目前還沒有模組在這裡提供視窗。"

msgid ""
"Click a key to change it, then press the new key (Ctrl, Shift or Alt can "
"come with it; Esc cancels)."
msgstr "點擊按鍵進行更改，然後按下新按鍵（可與Ctrl、Shift或Alt組合，按Esc取消）。"

msgid ""
"\"Off\" frees the key, the window still opens from here. Saved in "
"mods\\hotkeys.json."
msgstr "選擇「無」可取消按鍵，仍可從這裡打開視窗。儲存在mods\\hotkeys.json中。"

msgid "Reset all keys"
msgstr "重置所有按鍵"

msgid "Every key back to what its mod uses by default."
msgstr "將所有按鍵恢復為各模組的預設值。"

msgid "Mods"
msgstr "模組"

msgid "Open any mod window, or change or switch off its key."
msgstr "打開任意模組視窗，或更改、停用它的快速鍵。"

msgid "Press a key..."
msgstr "請按下按鍵..."

msgid "Press the new key now. Esc cancels."
msgstr "請按下新按鍵。按Esc取消。"

msgid "Click, then press the new key."
msgstr "點擊後按下新按鍵。"

msgid "No key for this window."
msgstr "此視窗沒有快速鍵。"

msgid "The key that opens this menu."
msgstr "打開此選單的按鍵。"

msgid "Two mods use the same key: open this to fix it."
msgstr "兩個模組使用了相同的按鍵：打開此處進行修正。"

msgid "no key"
msgstr "無按鍵"

msgid "also used by {0}"
msgstr "{0}也在使用"

msgid "Melvor Mod Loader {0}  -  {1} mod"
msgstr "Melvor Mod Loader {0}，模組：{1}"

msgid ""
"Click a key to change it, then press the new key (Ctrl, Shift or Alt can come with it; Esc cancels).\n"
"\"Off\" frees the key, the window still opens from here. Saved in mods\\hotkeys.json."
msgstr ""
"點擊按鍵進行更改，然後按下新按鍵（可與Ctrl、Shift或Alt組合，按Esc取消）。\n"
"選擇「無」可取消按鍵，仍可從這裡打開視窗。儲存在mods\\hotkeys.json中。"
